      "text": "Zicom Group is listed on the Australian Securities Exchange and headquartered in Singapore. Of its four operating clusters, Marine, Oil & Gas covers gas processing, compression, metering, industrial control and automation. The other three are Construction Equipment, Precision Engineering & Technologies, and MedTacc."
